## Frontend (`frontend/.env`)

| Variable | Read by | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `VITE_API_URL` | build | Address of the API as the browser reaches it. Fixed in the bundle at build time (a rebuild is needed to change it); also allowed by the frontend's Content Security Policy |
